iv class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Sphere\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Earth_Sphere_df31aa.gif\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.20<br/>July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>You will spawn in the Northwest part of the sphere and there might be some <a href=\"#/wiki/Muddy%20Earth%20Elemental\">Muddy Earth Elementals</a>, and/or <a href=\"#/wiki/Jagged%20Earth%20Elemental\">Jagged Earth Elementals</a> near so be careful.<br/>\nThe <a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Overlord\">Earth Overlord</a> can be spawned in the South part of the sphere.\n</p><p>The Earth Sphere is the <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a>'s part of <a href=\"#/quest/elemental-spheres-quest\">The Elemental Spheres Quest</a>. You need to use 20 <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Enchanted%20Emerald\">Small Enchanted Emeralds</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mysterious%20Machine\">Mysterious Machine</a> under <a href=\"#/wiki/Noodles%20Academy%20of%20Modern%20Magic\">Ivory Towers</a> in Edron to get access.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Earth Sphere creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th dat