 of Earth</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Natural%20Soil\">Natural Soil</a></li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a></li>\n<li>0-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a></li>\n<li>Twigs</li>\n<li>Seeds (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Clay Lump (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Overlord\"><img alt=\"Earth Overlord\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Earth_Overlord_6d7a3d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Overlord\">Earth Overlord</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,800</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1500+?</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mother%20Soil\">Mother Soil</a> (always)</li>\n<li>1-168× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></li>\n<li>Lump of Earth</li>\n<li>Shiny Stone</li>\n<li>Terra Mantle</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a></li>\n<li>Swamplair Armor (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"32pxd\"><img alt=\"32pxd\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_77aa91.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><figcaption>32pxd</figcaption></figure><p><i>This  article is a stub. You can help TibiaWiki by expanding it.</i></p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Reasons for stub: Needs a better map that shows spawns</p></div></div>","quests":[]}